"""Prelims places added to the map modules (Nov 2026 coverage scan).

Every place named in a Prelims PYQ that the maps lacked, plus full official sets where they
are short (all 18 biosphere reserves, all 16 mahajanapadas). Read by tools/build_maps.py.

Pin tuple: (name, lat, lon, states, note, pyq)
- states: list of states/UTs the point must fall in or touch (checked against the Survey of India
  based states file), or None for places outside India.
- pyq: Prelims/Mains question IDs that name the place.
Coordinates are approximate, for teaching.
"""

